&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 84px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;②連結営業利益の成長率に応じて設定した係数&lt;/p&gt;
